/* Pashto (پښتو).
 *
 * Not a transliteration of the Dari: the prayers have their own names in Pashto
 * (ماسپښين, مازديګر, ماخستن), several cities are spelled differently (لښکرګاه), and the
 * grammar is not the same language's grammar with different words. Where a sentence has
 * a past-tense transitive verb, the verb agrees with the *object* — "سهار مو وکړ", not a
 * subject-conjugated form. */

